grasp","pinch":"grasp","clap":"clap","leap":"frames 3 (kleap) / 6","cast":"breath/weep/cast/chant/eye","hit":"struck: the three hit frames","death":"six death frames, then lies on the last"},"view_map":"dir8() -> VIEW8: octant R = side (face +1), DR = front (+1), D = down, DL = front (-1), L = side (-1), UL = back (-1), U = up, UR = back (+1); D and U keep the last mirror. A pose missing a view falls back: down -> front, up -> back.","mirror":"Frames are painted facing screen-right (face +1). The web mirrors for face -1 by flipping the image about the anchor: x -> -x (a frame at dx with width w is drawn at -(dx + w)).","roll_note":"While rolling (P.roll > 0) the web draws the frame squashed to 70% height, bottom-anchored, and lifts it by sin(progress*PI)*3 world px; frames here are unsquashed.","scale":"Rendered at the desktop scale: 3 atlas px per world px (canvas RS 4 x the 0.75 world-scale creatures and heroes are drawn at). One yard (tile) = 108 x 54 px on the iso grid. Nearest-neighbour, as the web draws it; no downscale (the sprite art is painted at 1.5x-3x world grain; the web blits it at this size).","anchor":"Anchor (0,0) = the entity's world position projected by iso() (its ground point). (dx,dy) = offset from the anchor to the frame top-left. The web draws the ground shadow ellipse centred 2 world px (6 atlas px) below the anchor; shadows are NOT in the frames.","not_exported":"class lamp (drawn as its own list item beside the hero), the white hit-flash, skill/aura effects, ","source":"the class HD atlas (frameOf) drawn through drawMonk"}}